### Full digital business card
POST http://localhost:3000/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "query Profile { profile { fullName headline location summary githubUrl skills { name category level years } projects { title description stack highlights } experiences { company role startedAt finishedAt description stack } } }"
}

### Skill filter
POST http://localhost:3000/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "query Skills($category: String) { skills(category: $category) { name category level years } }",
  "variables": {
    "category": "Backend"
  }
}

### Live interview change
POST http://localhost:3000/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "mutation UpdateProfile($input: UpdateProfileInput!) { updateProfile(input: $input) { fullName headline location } }",
  "variables": {
    "input": {
      "headline": "Junior+ TypeScript Backend Developer",
      "location": "Remote"
    }
  }
}

### S3-compatible resume target metadata
POST http://localhost:3000/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "query ResumeUploadTarget($fileName: String!) { resumeUploadTarget(fileName: $fileName) { bucket key endpoint publicUrl } }",
  "variables": {
    "fileName": "resume.pdf"
  }
}
